{"acceptance_length": 8.372093023255815, "acceptance_lengths": [3, 6, 11, 10, 4, 7, 12, 2, 7, 5, 8, 6, 7, 10, 5, 6, 6, 16, 7, 10, 6, 3, 11, 16, 9, 5, 3, 3, 5, 16, 16, 12, 7, 16, 13, 2, 3, 12, 16, 16, 6, 8, 8], "accepted_draft_lengths": [2, 5, 10, 9, 3, 6, 11, 1, 6, 4, 7, 5, 6, 9, 4, 5, 5, 15, 6, 9, 5, 2, 10, 15, 8, 4, 2, 2, 4, 15, 15, 11, 6, 15, 12, 1, 2, 11, 15, 15, 5, 7, 7], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 23388434432, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 23388417024, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "We are given the following information:\n\n- The auditorium has **4 rows** of seats.\n- Each row has **18 seats**.\n- **One-fourth** of the seats were occupied by **administrators**.\n- **One-third** of the **remaining** seats were occupied by **parents**.\n- The **rest** were occupied by **students**.\n- We are to find how many **students** were in the auditorium.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Total number of seats\n\nThere are 4 rows, with 18 seats per row:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total seats} = 4 \\times 18 = 72\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Seats occupied by administrators\n\nOne-fourth of the seats were occupied by administrators:\n\n$$\n\\text{Admin seats} = \\frac{1}{4} \\times 72 = 18\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Remaining seats after administrators\n\nSubtract the admin seats from the total:\n\n$$\n\\text{Remaining seats} = 72 - 18 = 54\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Seats occupied by parents\n\nOne-third of the remaining seats were occupied by parents:\n\n$$\n\\text{Parent seats} = \\frac{1}{3} \\times 54 = 18\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Remaining seats for students\n\nSubtract the parent seats from the remaining seats:\n\n$$\n\\text{Student seats} = 54 - 18 = 36\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{36}\n$$\n\nSo, **36 students** were in the school auditorium.", "decode_seconds": 1.5741958511061969, "draft_calls": 43, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 91, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "16cf8c2000e8b55e51ce3c60c7707d0a98229e4818cf9471a234fa20e7bc660b", "method": "relay_svd1536", "output_hash": "29efe03c017649bd0037528e180a76ef877b63a288494aa1f382fc7306120d90", "output_tokens": 359, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 23522207232, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 23792189440, "problem_id": "gsm8k/1cd8fbe40f4cda30", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 270.038143157959, "prefill_full_target": 33.0274543762207, "prefill_relay": 0.1627199947834015, "relay": 9.487039998173714, "unattributed_runtime": 21.94698239862919, "verification_full_target": 1274.691291809082}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "36", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 1.609353631734848, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 23792189440, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 23758635008, "sampling_seed": 8507417292702617123, "sampling_temperature": 1.0, "target_calls": 43, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.0333000342361629, "turn_index": 0}
